      "name": "Jordan Air Patrol Backpack - Adult",
      "description": "<p>Experience pro-level utility and on-the-go comfort with the Jordan Air Patrol Backpack. Featuring a main compartment with a two-way zip closure and an inner laptop sleeve, this backpack keeps everything organised and easily accessible. The small front compartment with an organisational pocket offers secure storage for your keys, earphones, and other belongings, while the side bottle pockets help you stay hydrated on the go. Whether you’re going for practice on the court or a short trip, the Jordan Air Patrol Backpack makes for an ideal option for carrying your essentials in style.</p> <p><strong>Jordan Air Patrol Backpack features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Durable woven exterior ensures long-lasting use.</li> <li>Front zip pocket enables easy access to essentials.</li> <li>Passport pocket provides room for passport, cards, and IDs.</li> <li>Adjustable, padded shoulder straps with a buckle connector allow comfortable carrying.</li> <li>Dimensions 19.5\" H x 13.25\" W x 7\" D.</li> <li>100% polyester.</li> </ul>",
